{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Depart:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear up and leave on a\u00a0Roguelike RPG expedition to the unknown, strategize your way to victory against impossible odds in turn-based combat. It's time for the tyrannical rule of the GOBLIN KING to end!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806630/extras/296b44ff8da027adc95fb97a15f0636f.avif?t=1751124111\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DEFEAT THE GOBLIN KING is a solo dev endeavour in trying to create a fast paced, challenging and engaging turn based game where you build and empower your character as you go.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806630/extras/KingGoblinARTplayerMAGEpromo01.png?t=1751124111\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806630/extras/KingGoblinARTplayerARCHERpromo01.png?t=1751124111\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806630/extras/KingGoblinARTplayerKNIGHTpromo01.png?t=1751124111\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A journey with:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 characters, each with a unique moveset and stats</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 different zones with distinct visuals and challenges</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>50+ items in the form of potions, scrolls and artifacts</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p c